{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the will of fate, you were thrown from the human kingdom to the lands of demonic creatures. You found yourself in an abandoned shop for repairing skeleton minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head of a bone repair shop, you have to repair skeleton minions. During the day, you serve customers and repair their skeleton minions, and at night you search for high-quality body parts in the nearby human lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to spend rare body parts on repairs in a balanced way, since there are many customers, and body parts are limited.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906230?t=1758253392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/c702c64610278dbc2bfbf99889a51d18b775e631/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758253392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/76bcda64a1c16c16c7b8c5340113f728c6d2907e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758253392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/76bcda64a1c16c16c7b8c5340113f728c6d2907e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758253392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the will of fate, you were thrown from the human kingdom to the lands of demonic creatures. You found yourself in an abandoned shop for repairing skeleton minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head of a bone repair shop, you have to repair skeleton minions. During the day, you serve customers and repair their skeleton minions, and at night you search for high-quality b